   2.2 NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATIONS. Use by a Non-Profit Organization (including
        non-profit hospitals, charitable clinics, and small educational
        institutions below the Large-Educational threshold in Clause 1.5) is
        permitted WITHOUT License Fees ONLY AFTER the organization has applied
        for and RECEIVED WRITTEN PERMISSION from the Licensor. The permission
        letter is personal to the named organization, site, and machine count,
        is non-transferable, and may impose reasonable conditions (e.g.,
        acknowledgment of the Licensor in printed reports). Operating without
        prior written permission is a breach and infringement.
   2.3 COMMERCIAL / BUSINESS USE. All Commercial Use — including private
        homeopathic hospitals, nursing homes, multi-doctor clinics, pharmacies,
        diagnostic centres, telemedicine operations, reselling, hosting the
        Software for third parties, or using it internally in any
        revenue-generating enterprise — REQUIRES a separate paid commercial
        license agreement and payment of License Fees before installation or
        use. Contact the Licensor for a quotation.
   2.4 LARGE EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTIONS. Use by Large Educational Institutions
        (Clause 1.5) — including classroom/lab deployment, campus-wide
        installation, research projects run on funded/paid programs, and
        examination use — REQUIRES a separate institutional license and payment
        of License Fees, irrespective of whether the institution is government
        or private, and irrespective of whether fees are charged to students.
        Concession rates may be offered at the Licensor's sole discretion via
        written agreement only.
   2.5 NO IMPLIED RIGHTS. Nothing in this Agreement grants rights by
        implication, estoppel, exhaustion, or otherwise. Any use not expressly
        permitted above is prohibited.


